SUMMARY:West Side Story: Opening Night at Fulton
DESCRIPTION:A city divided\, a love forbidden\, a tragedy foretold.  \nShakespeare’s Romeo and Juliet is transported to 1950s New York City as two young\, idealistic lovers find themselves caught between warring street gangs\, the “American” Jets and the Puerto Rican Sharks. Their struggle to survive in a world of hate\, violence and prejudice is one of the most innovative\, heart-wrenching and relevant musical dramas of our time. \n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/west-side-story-opening-night-at-fulton/
LOCATION:Fulton Theatre: Mainstage\, 12 North Prince Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2025/08/West-Side-Story-Artwork-Reveal-4x5-1.avif
END:VEVENT
