SUMMARY:Kids Summer Camp with Happily Ever Crafter at Lancaster Art Vault
DESCRIPTION:Unleash Your Inner Artist at Summer Art Camp! 🎨  \n\nJoin us at the Lancaster Art Vault for a week of creativity and fun! Designed for young creators ages 7–10\, our camp dives into the world of famous artists through hands-on daily projects.\n\nWhen: June 22nd – June 26th\nTime: 12:00 PM – 3:00 PM\nAges: 7-10\nWhat to Expect: Multiple art projects every day\, plus plenty of time for games and snacks!\nCost: $200 for the full week\nReady to create? Fill out the form below\, and I’ll send you the link to finalize your registration and payment. Let’s make something amazing!\n\nHosted by Happily Ever Crafters.  For more infromation call 717-847-8931 \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/kids-summer-camp-with-happily-ever-crafter-at-lancaster-art-vault/
LOCATION:Lancaster Art Vault\, 100 North Queen Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community,Education & Classes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/04/IMG_4576.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Lancaster Art Vault":MAILTO:Info@LancasterArtVault.com
END:VEVENT
