SUMMARY:Worldbuilding 101: Grades 7-10 at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:Come explore the art of concept design and worldbuilding. In this workshop for students in grades 7-10\, we will delve into the art of developing secondary worlds from our own imaginations. Create character and creature designs\, write lore\, design props\, and set pieces to flesh out your world. This course is perfect for anyone interested in story based work and large scope artistic projects. Create your own world\, write your own lore and create visual art to guide your audience through it! This is a studio based class with lots of guidance to start followed by one-on-one instruction. Expect to have creative freedom within the bounds of the assignment! Register today! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/worldbuilding-101-grades-7-10-at-pcad/
LOCATION:Pennsylvania College of Art & Design – Center for Creative Exploration\, 204 North Prince Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
