SUMMARY:Trivioke Night at Southern Market
DESCRIPTION:Starts with music trivia\, then ends with karaoke! $1 off beer and wine from 7:00-9:00 PM during music trivia. Prizes for trivia winners are gift cards that can be redeemed at any Southern Market vendor. \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
